OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells through the morning.
OL,7,FBecoming increasingly cloudy with some
OL,8,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle
OL,9,Farriving by late-afternoon.
OL,10,FIncreasingly windy through the day.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOutbreaks of light rain and
OL,14,Fdrizzle should clear this evening to
OL,15,Fleave a largely dry night, with
OL,16,Fvariable amounts of cloud and
OL,17,Foccasional clear spells. Windy.
OL,18,FStaying mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
