OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FLargely dry and bright, with
OL,6,Fsunny spells at first, before a narrow
OL,7,Fband of light rain moves southeast
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon. Becoming drier
OL,9,Fby evening. Less windy. Feeling rather
OL,10,Fwarm.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith variable cloud and bright or
OL,14,Fsunny spells on Sunday. Staying fine
OL,15,Fand dry with sunny spells on Monday
OL,16,Fand Tuesday. Becoming very warm and
OL,17,Fhumid. Lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
